# UI Craft — وزین عدالت

Whenever the user asks to build or redesign a **section / page / component**, ship **premium legal-tech UI**, not generic AI layouts.

## Brand & Direction

- Brand: **وزین عدالت** — luxury legal + online startup speed
- Language: **Persian**, layout **RTL** (`dir="rtl"`)
- Fonts: Vazirmatn (body), Estedad (headings) — already wired in `src/styles/theme.css`
- Palette tokens live in `src/styles/globals.css` (`navy-*`, `gold-*`, semantic colors)
- **Never hardcode hex/rgb inside components** — use token classes (`bg-navy-900`, `text-gold-600`, `shadow-soft`)
- CTAs site-wide: prefer `CTA.login` / `CTA.contact` from `src/features/home/constants`

## Anti–“AI website” look (required)

Avoid these defaults unless the user explicitly asks:

- Purple / indigo gradients, neon glow, glassmorphism stacks
- Generic Inter/Roboto/system stacks as primary fonts
- Card grids with identical icon-in-circle + 3 lines of lorem
- Pill badge clusters, fake stat strips, emoji decoration
- Overcrowded heroes (stats + schedule + address + CTAs all in first viewport)
- Floating stickers / promo chips on hero media
- Dense “dashboard” composition on marketing pages

Prefer:

- Strong hierarchy (one job per section)
- Generous whitespace on desktop (`max-w-(--container-page)`, large padding)
- Soft elevation (`shadow-soft` / `shadow-lift`), thin borders, `rounded-2xl`
- Real contrast: light text on navy, navy text on off-white — never same-tone text/background
- Motion with purpose (2–3 intentional motions max per section); respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Section delivery pattern

For each new section:

1. Add types in `features/.../types` and data in `constants` when content is reusable
2. Build a focused component under `features/[name]/components/`
3. Compose in the page; keep sections importable and ordered
4. Use shared primitives: `Container`, `SectionHeading`, `Button`, `Reveal`
5. Mobile-first Tailwind; full-width primary CTAs on small screens where appropriate
6. Accessible focus, labels, and semantic landmarks (`section`, `nav`, headings)

Canonical examples: `src/features/home/components/hero-section.tsx`, `process-section.tsx`, `why-us-section.tsx`

